lse,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":9052,"executes":2193,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/da63e08e93d5ee47e3468cfac2e8307291f0745d3deaf1e5593b16294f6855b1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/14218711698-1757714403751.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/14218711698-1757714403751.webp"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/da63e08e93d5ee47e3468cfac2e8307291f0745d3deaf1e5593b16294f6855b1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/14218711698-1757714403751.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/14218711698-1757714403751.webp"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2025-09-12T22:00:03.858Z","updatedAt":"2025-09-12T22:00:03.858Z","lastBump":"2025-09-12T22:00:03.858Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Pozzyz0/ScriptBlox/refs/heads/main/Criminal%20Tycoon\",true))()","features":"VisionHub Script Features\n1. Profile ID Prompt\n\nGUI popup asks for your Roblox profile ID.\n\nValidates ID against workspace.Tycoons.\n\nPrevents running if invalid.\n\n2. Auto-Collect ATM\n\nTeleports to your Tycoon ATM’s CollectTrigger.\n\nWaits safely (task.wait(0.7)) before restoring character position.\n\nCollects automatically on button press.\n\n3. Auto-Buy System\n\nCash Only: Buys buttons that cost in-game cash.\n\nMedallion Only: Buys buttons that cost medallions.\n\nRebirth Only: Buys rebirth-locked buttons.\n\nSkips Robux buttons (detects “R$”, “Robux”, or Robux icon).\n\nConfigurable delay slider (0.1s – 3s).\n\nBackground loop scans all purchase buttons and auto-touches them.\n\n4. Auto-Rob System\n\nWorks on Gas Station and MaxiMart (Supermarket).\n\nChecks if stores are active (light sensor turns lime green).\n\nRequires a gun equipped (prevents starting unarmed).\n\nSafe teleport system (TweenService + offset) prevents falling.\n\nRobs tills, fires prompts automatically.\n\nCollects dropped cash, with max carry capacity.\n\nConfigurable Max Hold (default = 5).\n\nStatus label shows live updates:\n\n“Ready (cap)”\n\n“Robbing…”\n\n“Inactive”\n\n“Done (x/y)”\n\n“Returned to base”\n\n5. Rebirth Tracking\n\nTab shows current rebirth count.\n\n“Check Rebirth” button reads Player.SharedData.Rebirths.\n\nUpdates label dynamically.\n\n6. UI System\n\nBuilt with Orion UI Library.\n\nTabs:\n\nMain: Tycoon ID, Auto-Collect ATM.\n\nAutoBuy: Delay slider, 3 toggles (Cash, Medallion, Rebirth).\n\nAuto-Rob: Store checks, autorob buttons, max hold config.\n\nNecessities: Current rebirth tracker.\n\nNotifications for each major action (success, fail, warnings).\n\n7. Safety + Usability\n\nAll teleports are “smooth” or “safe” with 2-step offset.\n\nBag capacity detection (prevents over-collect).\n\nError handling (missing Tycoon, missing ATM, inactive store).\n\nProtects GUI in exploit environments (syn.protect_gui, gethui).","tags":["Keyless","VisionHub","Roblox","TycoonScript","AutoRob"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"68a4ab6a8f824dfe93a14980","username":"ntjustinZenith","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"68a4ab6a8f824dfe93a14980","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T02:59:12.140Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"68c497e45e919d64b3ab4b14","editBy":{"_id":"68a4ab6a8f824dfe93a14980","username":"ntjustinZenith","status":"offline","id":"68a4ab6a8f824dfe93a14980"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-09-12T22:00:04.024Z"}],"comments":[]},{"_id":"6845bfe6887257f4604238fe","title":"Auto Farm","game":{